  "doc_id": "01a0743b-c335-770d-9355-433db8271e48",
  "text": "## Data Security  \n**How We Protect Customer Data:**\n- Encryption: TLS 1.3 (in transit), AES-256 (at rest)\n- Access control: RBAC (role-based access)\n- Audit logs: All access recorded\n- Physical security: Locked cabinets, secure facilities\n- Employee training: All staff trained on GDPR  \n**Your Responsibility:**\n- Don't share passwords\n- Log out when leaving desk\n- Don't discuss customer data publicly\n- Report security concerns immediately\n- Lock documents when not in use",
  "name": "Chunk 30/61",
  "_domain": "banking.communications",
  "prev_chunk_id": "01a0743b-c335-770d-9355-433db8271e48_029",
  "next_chunk_id": "01a0743b-c335-770d-9355-433db8271e48_031",
